*   **Automated Scraping and Data Harvesting:** You may not crawl, scrape, harvest, mine, or extract text, images, code, or metadata from this repository or published website using any automated system, including but not limited to spiders, scrapers, crawlers, offline readers, AI bots, or API-based extractors.
