### 3. Technical Assertions (Robots.txt and Metadata)
The presence of machine-readable files (such as `robots.txt` declaring `Disallow: /` for AI crawlers) or metadata (such as `<meta name="robots" content="noai, noimageai">`) constitutes an active, technical assertion of this license. However, the absence of such metadata or technical configurations does not waive any terms of this license.

